msgid "Objetos de resultado"
msgstr "Result objects"

msgid ""
"Toda carta de control devuelve un :class:`~pccpy.ControlChart` (las "
"multivariadas devuelven la subclase :class:`~pccpy.MultivariateChart`), "
"con un :class:`~pccpy.Panel` por cada gráfico que la compone (por "
"ejemplo, el panel ``\"I\"`` y el panel ``\"MR\"`` de una carta I-MR)."
msgstr ""
"Every control chart returns a :class:`~pccpy.ControlChart` (multivariate "
"ones return the subclass :class:`~pccpy.MultivariateChart`), with one "
":class:`~pccpy.Panel` for each plot that makes it up (for example, the "
"``\"I\"`` panel and the ``\"MR\"`` panel of an I-MR chart)."

msgid "Dibuja todos los paneles de la carta, apilados. Devuelve la figura."
msgstr "Draws all the panels of the chart, stacked. Returns the figure."

msgid ""
"``zones=True`` (por defecto) agrega las líneas de 1 y 2 sigma en todos "
"los paneles, igual que Minitab. Pasa ``zones=False`` para mostrar solo "
"LCS, LC y LCI. Los puntos que fallan una prueba se marcan en rojo con el "
"número de la prueba. ``legend=True`` (por defecto) agrega una leyenda a "
"los paneles con dos series (la CUSUM: «C+ (suma superior)» y «C- (suma "
"inferior)»); pasa ``legend=False`` para quitarla."
msgstr ""
"``zones=True`` (default) adds the 1 and 2 sigma lines to all the panels, "
"just like Minitab. Pass ``zones=False`` to show only UCL, CL and LCL. "
"Points that fail a test are marked in red with the test number. "
"``legend=True`` (default) adds a legend to the panels with two series "
"(the CUSUM: \"C+ (upper sum)\" and \"C- (lower sum)\"); pass "
"``legend=False`` to remove it."

msgid "Parámetros"
msgstr "Parameters"

msgid ""
"Resultado de una carta de control: paneles, parámetros por etapa y "
"pruebas."
msgstr "Result of a control chart: panels, per-stage parameters and tests."

msgid ""
"Probabilidad de que el estadístico graficado quede por debajo, por encima"
" o entre valores, con el proceso en control."
msgstr ""
"Probability that the plotted statistic falls below, above or between "
"values, with the process in control."

msgid ""
"Usa la distribución del estadístico de cada panel con los parámetros de "
"la carta (los límites y la sigma que se ven en el gráfico), tratados como"
" conocidos: normal en I, Xbar y EWMA; rango de normales en MR y R; "
"σ·√(χ²ₙ₋₁/(n−1)) en S; binomial en P y NP; Poisson en C y U; geométrica "
"en G y Weibull en T. No admiten esta consulta la CUSUM, la media móvil, "
"la carta de zona, las de Laney ni las multivariadas (``ValueError``)."
msgstr ""
"Uses the distribution of each panel's statistic with the chart parameters"
" (the limits and sigma shown in the plot), treated as known: normal in I,"
" Xbar and EWMA; range of normals in MR and R; σ·√(χ²ₙ₋₁/(n−1)) in S; "
"binomial in P and NP; Poisson in C and U; geometric in G and Weibull in "
"T. The CUSUM, the moving average, the zone chart, the Laney charts and "
"the multivariate charts do not support this query (``ValueError``)."

msgid "Panel de la carta (``chart.panels``); por defecto el primero."
msgstr "Chart panel (``chart.panels``); the first one by default."

msgid ""
"``P(X < below)`` y ``P(X > above)``; con ambos, la probabilidad de quedar"
" fuera (suma de las dos partes). En las cartas de atributos la "
"desigualdad es estricta sobre el conteo (en P y U, el valor está en "
"proporción o defectos por unidad). Son valores del estadístico: en "
"unidades originales si la carta se calculó con ``transform=`` y "
"``scale=\"original\"`` (solo en los paneles I y Xbar; los de dispersión, "
"en la escala transformada)."
msgstr ""
"``P(X < below)`` and ``P(X > above)``; with both, the probability of "
"falling outside (the sum of the two parts). In attribute charts the "
"inequality is strict on the count (in P and U the value is a proportion "
"or defects per unit). These are values of the statistic: in original "
"units if the chart was computed with ``transform=`` and "
"``scale=\"original\"`` (only in the I and Xbar panels; dispersion panels "
"are in the transformed scale)."

msgid "``P(a ≤ X ≤ b)``; no se combina con ``below`` ni ``above``."
msgstr "``P(a ≤ X ≤ b)``; it is not combined with ``below`` or ``above``."

msgid ""
"Puntos (base 1) de la carta de que se pide la probabilidad; cada uno usa "
"su tamaño de muestra, su etapa y su ponderación. Es obligatorio cuando la"
" distribución cambia de un punto a otro (``n`` variable, etapas, EWMA)."
msgstr ""
"Chart points (1-based) whose probability is requested; each one uses its "
"own sample size, stage and weighting. It is required when the "
"distribution changes from one point to another (variable ``n``, stages, "
"EWMA)."

msgid "Devuelve"
msgstr "Returns"

msgid ""
"*ProbabilityResult* -- Con ``probability`` y ``ppm``; ``dpmo``, ``dpu`` y"
" ``sigma`` valen ``None`` (no hay defectos) y trae ``panel`` y ``point``."
msgstr ""
"*ProbabilityResult* -- With ``probability`` and ``ppm``; ``dpmo``, "
"``dpu`` and ``sigma`` are ``None`` (there are no defects) and it carries "
"``panel`` and ``point``."

msgid ""
"Asocia una etiqueta a cada punto graficado (fechas, lotes…) y devuelve la"
" propia carta."
msgstr ""
"Associates a label with each plotted point (dates, lots…) and returns the"
" chart itself."

msgid ""
"Las cartas calculadas con una serie de pandas con índice de fechas (o de "
"texto) ya las traen. Con etiquetas, el gráfico rotula el eje x con ellas,"
" ``to_frame()`` y ``violations()`` añaden la columna ``label`` y "
"``summary()`` las muestra junto al número de punto. El orden y el cálculo"
" no cambian."
msgstr ""
"Charts computed from a pandas Series with a date (or text) index already "
"carry them. With labels, the plot labels the x axis with them, "
"``to_frame()`` and ``violations()`` add the ``label`` column and "
"``summary()`` shows them next to the point number. The order and the "
"computation do not change."

msgid "Una etiqueta por punto graficado (observaciones o subgrupos)."
msgstr "One label per plotted point (observations or subgroups)."

msgid "Tipo del valor devuelto"
msgstr "Return type"

msgid "Tabla ancha: una fila por punto, columnas por panel."
msgstr "Wide table: one row per point, columns per panel."

msgid ""
"Con ``stable=True`` las columnas llevan claves canónicas en inglés que no"
" cambian con el idioma."
msgstr ""
"With ``stable=True`` the columns carry canonical English keys that do not"
" change with the language."

msgid ""
"Tabla de puntos que fallan pruebas: panel, punto (base 1), prueba, valor "
"y descripción."
msgstr ""
"Table of points that fail tests: panel, point (1-based), test, value and "
"description."

msgid "True si ninguna prueba solicitada falló en ningún panel."
msgstr "True if no requested test failed in any panel."

msgid "Exporta la carta a un archivo Excel (.xlsx)."
msgstr "Exports the chart to an Excel (.xlsx) file."

msgid ""
"Requiere ``openpyxl`` (``pip install openpyxl``). Cada panel ocupa una "
"hoja; las violaciones van en una hoja adicional."
msgstr ""
"Requires ``openpyxl`` (``pip install openpyxl``). Each panel takes one "
"sheet; the violations go in an additional sheet."

msgid ""
"Dibuja la carta con matplotlib. Ver "
":func:`pccpy.plotting.plot_control_chart`."
msgstr ""
"Draws the chart with matplotlib. See "
":func:`pccpy.plotting.plot_control_chart`."

msgid "Guarda el gráfico en un archivo (PNG, SVG, PDF, …)."
msgstr "Saves the plot to a file (PNG, SVG, PDF, …)."

msgid "Ruta de destino, p. ej. ``\"carta_imr.png\"`` o ``\"carta.pdf\"``."
msgstr "Destination path, e.g. ``\"imr_chart.png\"`` or ``\"chart.pdf\"``."

msgid ""
"Resolución en puntos por pulgada (solo relevante para formatos de mapa de"
" bits). Por defecto 150."
msgstr ""
"Resolution in dots per inch (only relevant for bitmap formats). Default "
"150."

msgid "Argumentos adicionales para :meth:`plot`."
msgstr "Additional arguments for :meth:`plot`."

msgid ""
"Carta multivariada: agrega los datos necesarios para diagnosticar una "
"señal."
msgstr "Multivariate chart: adds the data needed to diagnose a signal."

msgid "Contribución de cada variable al T² de un punto (``point`` en base 1)."
msgstr "Contribution of each variable to the T² of a point (``point`` is 1-based)."

msgid ""
"Para cada variable j se calcula ``d_j = T² - T²_(-j)``, donde ``T²_(-j)``"
" es el T² del mismo punto sin la variable j (Runger, Alt y Montgomery, "
"1996). Un valor grande señala la variable que más aporta a la señal; las "
"contribuciones no suman T². Si la carta se calculó con ``stages``, usa la"
" media y la covarianza de la etapa a la que pertenece ese punto."
msgstr ""
"For each variable j, ``d_j = T² - T²_(-j)`` is computed, where "
"``T²_(-j)`` is the T² of the same point without variable j (Runger, Alt "
"and Montgomery, 1996). A large value points to the variable that "
"contributes most to the signal; the contributions do not add up to T². If"
" the chart was computed with ``stages``, it uses the mean and covariance "
"of the stage that point belongs to."

msgid "Un gráfico individual dentro de una carta (p. ej. el gráfico I o el MR)."
msgstr "An individual plot within a chart (e.g. the I or the MR plot)."

msgid "Índices (base 0) de todos los puntos con alguna prueba fallida."
msgstr "Indices (0-based) of all the points with any failed test."

msgid "Tabla del panel: una fila por punto."
msgstr "Panel table: one row per point."

msgid "Capacidad y normalidad devuelven, respectivamente:"
msgstr "Capability and normality return, respectively:"

msgid "Resultado de un análisis de capacidad para datos normales."
msgstr "Result of a capability analysis for normal data."

msgid "Defectos por millón de oportunidades (PPM esperado general)."
msgstr "Defects per million opportunities (overall expected PPM)."

msgid "Z.bench general = Φ⁻¹(1 − P(defecto total))."
msgstr "Overall Z.bench = Φ⁻¹(1 − P(total defect))."

msgid "type"
msgstr "type"

msgid "Nivel sigma del proceso"
msgstr "Process sigma level"

msgid "Tabla resumen (una fila por estadístico)."
msgstr "Summary table (one row per statistic)."

msgid ""
"Con ``stable=True`` las filas llevan claves canónicas en inglés que no "
"cambian con el idioma."
msgstr ""
"With ``stable=True`` the rows carry canonical English keys that do not "
"change with the language."

msgid ""
"Probabilidad de que una observación del proceso caiga por debajo, por "
"encima o entre valores."
msgstr ""
"Probability that an observation of the process falls below, above or "
"between values."

msgid ""
"Supone que el proceso es normal con ``mean`` y la sigma indicada (en la "
"escala transformada si hubo ``transform``) y trata esos parámetros "
"estimados como conocidos. Los valores van en las **unidades originales** "
"de los datos."
msgstr ""
"Assumes the process is normal with ``mean`` and the given sigma (on the "
"transformed scale if ``transform`` was used) and treats those estimated "
"parameters as known. Values are given in the **original units** of the "
"data."

msgid ""
"``P(X < below)`` y ``P(X > above)``; con ambos, la probabilidad de quedar"
" fuera (suma de las dos partes)."
msgstr ""
"``P(X < below)`` and ``P(X > above)``; with both, the probability of "
"falling outside (the sum of the two parts)."

msgid "Sigma general (por defecto) o dentro de los subgrupos."
msgstr "Overall sigma (default) or within-subgroup sigma."

msgid "Oportunidades de defecto por unidad, para ``dpu = opportunities · p``."
msgstr "Defect opportunities per unit, for ``dpu = opportunities · p``."

msgid ""
"*ProbabilityResult* -- Con ``probability``, ``ppm``, ``dpmo`` y ``dpu`` "
"(``None`` con ``between``)."
msgstr ""
"*ProbabilityResult* -- With ``probability``, ``ppm``, ``dpmo`` and "
"``dpu`` (``None`` with ``between``)."

msgid "Exporta el análisis de capacidad a un archivo Excel (.xlsx)."
msgstr "Exports the capability analysis to an Excel (.xlsx) file."

msgid "Requiere ``openpyxl`` (``pip install openpyxl``)."
msgstr "Requires ``openpyxl`` (``pip install openpyxl``)."

msgid "Histograma de capacidad. Ver :func:`pccpy.plotting.plot_capability`."
msgstr "Capability histogram. See :func:`pccpy.plotting.plot_capability`."

msgid ""
"Capacidad por el método de percentiles (Minitab, distribuciones no "
"normales)."
msgstr "Capability by the percentile method (Minitab, non-normal distributions)."

msgid ""
"Probabilidad de que una observación caiga por debajo, por encima o entre "
"valores (distribución ajustada)."
msgstr ""
"Probability that an observation falls below, above or between values "
"(fitted distribution)."

msgid ""
"Usa ``cdf``/``sf`` de la distribución ajustada (:attr:`frozen`) y trata "
"sus parámetros estimados como conocidos. Mismos parámetros que "
":meth:`CapabilityResult.probability`, salvo que ``sigma='within'`` no "
"existe aquí (la distribución no tiene sigma «dentro») y lanza "
"``ValueError``."
msgstr ""
"Uses ``cdf``/``sf`` of the fitted distribution (:attr:`frozen`) and "
"treats its estimated parameters as known. Same parameters as "
":meth:`CapabilityResult.probability`, except that ``sigma='within'`` does"
" not exist here (the distribution has no \"within\" sigma) and raises "
"``ValueError``."

msgid "Exporta el análisis de capacidad no normal a un archivo Excel (.xlsx)."
msgstr "Exports the non-normal capability analysis to an Excel (.xlsx) file."

msgid "Probabilidad de un evento sobre el proceso y sus medidas derivadas."
msgstr "Probability of an event about the process and its derived measures."

msgid ""
"Con un número en la entrada, las medidas son números; con arreglos, "
"arreglos de la forma resultante."
msgstr ""
"With a number as input the measures are numbers; with arrays, arrays of "
"the resulting shape."

msgid "Notas"
msgstr "Notes"

msgid "Campos:"
msgstr "Fields:"

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"``event`` ({'below', 'above', 'outside', 'between'}): Evento: por debajo "
"de un valor, por encima, fuera de un intervalo (ambos) o entre dos "
"valores."
msgstr ""
"``event`` ({'below', 'above', 'outside', 'between'}): Event: below a "
"value, above it, outside an interval (both) or between two values."

msgid "``probability`` (float | ndarray): Probabilidad del evento, entre 0 y 1."
msgstr ""
"``probability`` (float | ndarray): Probability of the event, between 0 "
"and 1."

msgid "``ppm`` (float | ndarray): ``1e6 · probability`` (partes por millón)."
msgstr "``ppm`` (float | ndarray): ``1e6 · probability`` (parts per million)."

msgid ""
"``dpmo`` (float | ndarray | None): Defectos por millón de oportunidades "
"(``1e6 · probability``); ``None`` con ``between`` (no es un defecto)."
msgstr ""
"``dpmo`` (float | ndarray | None): Defects per million opportunities "
"(``1e6 · probability``); ``None`` with ``between`` (it is not a defect)."

msgid ""
"``dpu`` (float | ndarray | None): Defectos por unidad: ``opportunities · "
"probability``; ``None`` con ``between``."
msgstr ""
"``dpu`` (float | ndarray | None): Defects per unit: ``opportunities · "
"probability``; ``None`` with ``between``."

msgid ""
"``p_below, p_above`` (float | ndarray | None): Las dos partes del evento "
"(``None`` si no hay esa parte)."
msgstr ""
"``p_below, p_above`` (float | ndarray | None): The two parts of the event"
" (``None`` if there is no such part)."

msgid ""
"``below, above`` (float | ndarray | None): Valores usados, en unidades "
"originales (los límites de especificación si se heredaron)."
msgstr ""
"``below, above`` (float | ndarray | None): Values used, in original units"
" (the specification limits if they were inherited)."

msgid ""
"``between`` (tuple | None): Par ``(inferior, superior)`` usado con "
"``between``."
msgstr "``between`` (tuple | None): Pair ``(lower, upper)`` used with ``between``."

msgid ""
"``sigma`` (str | None): ``'overall'`` o ``'within'``; ``None`` en los "
"resultados de las cartas de control."
msgstr ""
"``sigma`` (str | None): ``'overall'`` or ``'within'``; ``None`` in the "
"control chart results."

msgid ""
"``opportunities`` (int): Oportunidades de defecto por unidad (para "
"``dpu``)."
msgstr "``opportunities`` (int): Defect opportunities per unit (for ``dpu``)."

msgid ""
"``panel`` (str | None): Panel de la carta de control "
"(``ControlChart.probability``); ``None`` en capacidad."
msgstr ""
"``panel`` (str | None): Control chart panel "
"(``ControlChart.probability``); ``None`` in capability."

msgid ""
"``point`` (int | ndarray | None): Puntos (base 1) de la carta de que se "
"pidió la probabilidad; ``None`` si no se indicó ``point=`` y en "
"capacidad."
msgstr ""
"``point`` (int | ndarray | None): Chart points (1-based) whose "
"probability was requested; ``None`` if ``point=`` was not given and in "
"capability."

msgid ""
"En una carta de control el evento no es un defecto: ``dpmo`` y ``dpu`` "
"valen ``None``."
msgstr ""
"In a control chart the event is not a defect: ``dpmo`` and ``dpu`` are "
"``None``."

msgid "Tabla con una fila por elemento."
msgstr "Table with one row per element."

msgid "Texto con el evento y la tabla de medidas."
msgstr "Text with the event and the table of measures."

msgid "True si se rechaza la normalidad al nivel ``alpha``."
msgstr "True if normality is rejected at level ``alpha``."

msgid "Herramientas de análisis de proceso"
msgstr "Process analysis tools"

msgid ""
"Los demás módulos devuelven objetos propios documentados en sus páginas "
"de referencia:"
msgstr ""
"The other modules return their own objects, documented in their reference"
" pages:"

msgid ":class:`~pccpy.RunChartResult` — véase :doc:`run_chart_y_precontrol`."
msgstr ":class:`~pccpy.RunChartResult` — see :doc:`run_chart_y_precontrol`."

msgid ":class:`~pccpy.PreControlResult` — véase :doc:`run_chart_y_precontrol`."
msgstr ":class:`~pccpy.PreControlResult` — see :doc:`run_chart_y_precontrol`."

msgid ":class:`~pccpy.ToleranceResult` — véase :doc:`tolerancia`."
msgstr ":class:`~pccpy.ToleranceResult` — see :doc:`tolerancia`."

msgid ""
":class:`~pccpy.SamplingPlanAttributes`, "
":class:`~pccpy.DoublePlanAttributes`, "
":class:`~pccpy.SamplingPlanVariables`, :class:`~pccpy.DodgeRomigPlan` — "
"véase :doc:`muestreo_aceptacion`."
msgstr ""
":class:`~pccpy.SamplingPlanAttributes`, "
":class:`~pccpy.DoublePlanAttributes`, "
":class:`~pccpy.SamplingPlanVariables`, :class:`~pccpy.DodgeRomigPlan` — "
"see :doc:`muestreo_aceptacion`."

msgid ""
":class:`~pccpy.GageRRResult`, :class:`~pccpy.Type1Result`, "
":class:`~pccpy.LinearityResult`, :class:`~pccpy.AttributeAgreementResult`"
" — véase :doc:`msa`."
msgstr ""
":class:`~pccpy.GageRRResult`, :class:`~pccpy.Type1Result`, "
":class:`~pccpy.LinearityResult`, :class:`~pccpy.AttributeAgreementResult`"
" — see :doc:`msa`."

